// parallelism: 6,fused=none
// Disabling fusing asks for plain buffered channels throughout, so no channel
// is tiny (`╎`) here, not even the matched lane-to-lane ones between the two
// `where` operators. Their number still scales with the degree, so this trades
// memory for throughput; it also keeps the pipelines that request no
// parallelism at all, which plan as `disabled`, off the small budget.
from {x: 1}
where x > 0
where x < 3
